OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies sexually assaulting two
OL,4,Agirls at hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was charged with raping a
OL,7,F15-year-old girl after police were
OL,8,Fcalled to a hotel in Kenilworth has
OL,9,Fpleaded not guilty.
OL,11,FSyrian national Ahmad Hania, 27, was
OL,12,Fassisted by an Arabic interpreter at
OL,13,FWarwick Crown Court on Thursday as he
OL,14,Fentered not guilty pleas to six counts
OL,15,Fof sexual assault.
OL,17,FThe charges all relate to a date in
OL,18,FAugust this year when Warwickshire
OL,19,FPolice were called to a hotel in
OL,20,FKenilworth following reports that two
OL,21,Fgirls, who cannot be identified, had
OL,22,Fbeen sexually assaulted.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
