OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies sexually assaulting two
OL,4,Agirls at hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe indictment against Hania, of King
OL,7,FEdward Road, Nuneaton, alleges that he
OL,8,Fkissed and sexually touched both
OL,9,Falleged victims without their consent
OL,10,Fand committed an offence of rape
OL,11,Fagainst one of them.
